{
  "name": "Trace a human approval across a wait with OpenRouter and OpenTelemetry",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Webhook - Approval Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        -160,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "audit-trace-approval",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "Enrich Request Sub-workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        },
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultName": "Select the imported Exercise 5 enrichment sub-workflow"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Policy Service Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "notes": "This is a public echo endpoint for inspecting trace headers. It is not a policy engine.",
      "position": [
        320,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://postman-echo.com/get",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Approval Proposal Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        560,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Request {{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').item.json.requestId }}: amount {{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').item.json.amount }} cents, tier {{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').item.json.customerTier }}, prior refunds {{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').item.json.priorRefunds12mo }}, reason {{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').item.json.reason }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a refund policy assistant. You propose a decision for a human approver, you never decide.\n\nGiven the enriched request, reply with one short paragraph recommending approve or decline, citing the amount, the customer tier, and the number of prior refunds in the last 12 months."
        },
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.7
    },
    {
      "name": "OpenRouter - Approval",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter",
      "position": [
        560,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "openai/gpt-4.1-mini",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "32682db9-95d0-4f57-b17b-ed074de14174",
      "name": "Return Approval Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        820,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ requestId: $(\"Enrich Request Sub-workflow\").first().json.requestId, proposal: $json.output, executionId: $execution.id, resumeUrl: $execution.resumeUrl }) }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "name": "Wait for Human Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        1040,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "5f388332-650c-4f29-aaec-971ce6400075",
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "webhook",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseData": "firstEntryJson",
        "responseMode": "lastNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "name": "Template Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -780,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## Trace a human approval across a wait with OpenRouter and OpenTelemetry\n\n### Quick overview\nThis workflow enriches a refund request, drafts an approval proposal with an AI agent, and waits for a human to approve or reject it, so you can follow one execution across the wait with OpenTelemetry tracing. It is the Exercise 5 template from the n8n Production AI Playbook post on Audit & Trace. No payment is processed.\n\n### How it works\n1. Receives a POST webhook request with a requestId, amount in cents, reason and a traceparent header.\n2. Enrich Request Sub-workflow validates the request and adds simulated customer context.\n3. Policy Service Call sends an HTTP request that carries the trace context to an echo service.\n4. Approval Proposal Agent drafts a proposal using an OpenRouter chat model.\n5. Return Approval Request responds with the proposal, executionId and resumeUrl.\n6. Wait for Human Approval pauses until a decision is posted to the resume URL.\n7. Validate Approval checks the decision, and Record Approval saves it. Invalid decisions stop at Reject Approval.\n\n### Setup\n1. Import, save and publish the Exercise 5 enrichment sub-workflow, then select it in Enrich Request Sub-workflow.\n2. Add an OpenRouter API credential to OpenRouter - Approval.\n3. Optionally enable OpenTelemetry tracing in Settings > OpenTelemetry.\n4. Select Execute workflow and POST `{\"requestId\":\"REQ-2001\",\"amount\":4999,\"reason\":\"duplicate charge\"}` with a traceparent header.\n5. POST `{\"approved\":true,\"approver\":\"Demo reviewer\"}` to the returned resumeUrl. In production, authenticate the reviewer and protect the resume endpoint."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e093264d-8611-4ef7-9e07-85b1d1f1bae2",
      "name": "Validate Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1260,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "78b66037-ddf9-4e5e-99af-f39161bfb212",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ typeof $json.body.approved === 'boolean' && typeof $json.body.approver === 'string' && $json.body.approver.trim() !== '' }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "80717cf4-55c6-40b4-a364-5d0b929c3b9c",
      "name": "Reject Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        1500,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "approved must be a JSON boolean and approver is required for this demo"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7948e3bf-9256-4522-9115-505292cd5a67",
      "name": "Record Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1500,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "3a453003-fe1c-4087-8f2e-1a48a3e33168",
              "name": "requestId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Enrich Request Sub-workflow').first().json.requestId }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "112923ca-c6b1-4497-9c91-b014f447030d",
              "name": "proposal",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Approval Proposal Agent').first().json.output }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "c111a810-5de8-4c97-9b9c-d03c64fe1a67",
              "name": "submittedApprover",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.approver.trim() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e40224f6-3810-4a2e-a7a5-155aa9b18173",
              "name": "approved",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.approved }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "04c39bea-baa2-47cc-87ec-57a5065de0ee",
              "name": "decision",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.approved ? 'approved' : 'declined' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "3a2e20a8-8167-4314-b55a-a99c255d4aa8",
              "name": "recordedAt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "cee6fa37-411c-45e6-b25c-d8eac6c3676a",
              "name": "paymentProcessed",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Validate Approval": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Record Approval",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Reject Approval",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Policy Service Call": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Approval Proposal Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OpenRouter - Approval": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Approval Proposal Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Approval Proposal Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Return Approval Request",
